CONTEXT OnlyTarget
-- B is the target of the relation x, and no term names B.
-- Without a table for B, nothing records that "b2" is a B.
CLASSIFY B ISA A
CLASSIFY C ISA A
REPRESENT A TYPE MULTITABLE
RELATION naam[A*Text] [UNI]
RELATION rc[C*Text] [UNI]
RELATION x[A*B]
POPULATION naam CONTAINS [ ("a1","A een"), ("b2","B twee") ]
POPULATION x CONTAINS [ ("a1","b2") ]
RULE r : x~;x |- naam;naam~
ROLE Tester MAINTAINS r
ENDCONTEXT
